 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** $O(N)$ where $N$ is the number of cells, as each cell is processed independently. The constant factor is higher than standard Marching Cubes due to the additional arithmetic for resolving ambiguities (multiplications, comparisons, and potentially quadratic root checks) [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$ per cell for the lookup table (33 entries). No global data structures are required [S1, unofficial].
